---
layout: changelog
title: Extra firewall protection for Nuxt Image on Cloud Sites
date: 2026-10-31
tags: security, firewall, sites
---

A security issue was found in Nuxt Image and the `ipx` library it uses. **Appwrite Cloud** now blocks some of the related requests to [Sites](/docs/products/sites) at the firewall. This is extra protection only. It does not replace an upgrade.

If you run a Nuxt site, update `@nuxt/image` to 1.11.2 or 2.2.1, or `ipx` to 2.1.2, 3.1.3, or 4.1.0, then create a new deployment.

**Self-hosted Appwrite** does not get this firewall change. Update the same packages in the site and redeploy.

